          text:
              'I wonder how many kind things happen when nobody is watching."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66466),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67805),
          text: 'That question stayed with them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67805),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 75285),
          text:
              'On the way home, Akhlaaq saw that the caretaker outside their building was trying to move a stack of empty boxes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75285),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78965),
          text: 'He hurried over and helped without announcing it to anyone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79279),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 84365),
          text:
              'Imaan noticed a neighbour\'s parcel left near the gate and carried it safely to her door.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 84365),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87153),
          text: 'Neither sibling mentioned the acts at dinner.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91693),
          text:
              'Ammi eventually asked, "Why are both of you smiling at each other?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91693),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94453),
          text: '"No reason," Akhlaaq said too quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95813),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97493),
          text: '"We were trying something.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 97493),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100933),
          text: 'A kindness that nobody had to praise."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102453),
          text: 'Ammi smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102453),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105453),
          text: '"That can be a beautiful kind of goodness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105541),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112541),
          text:
              'The Prophet Muhammad, peace and blessings be upon him, taught that every good deed is charity.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112979),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116041),
          text: 'Allah sees what people may never notice."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116041),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122041),
          text:
              'The next day, they found Rayyan reading near a small bookshop beside the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122041),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127931),
          text:
              'He traced each line with his finger, completely absorbed in the story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127931),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131389),
          text: 'A young man was arranging books outside the shop.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131389),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133493),
          text: 'He greeted them warmly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134379),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135154),
          text: '"Assalam o Alaikum.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135154),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135265),
          text: 'I am Zameer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135929),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 139029),
          text: 'Rayyan comes here whenever he can."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 139029),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141941),
          text: 'Rayyan looked slightly embarrassed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141941),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145477),
          text: '"I only borrow books that he allows me to borrow."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145477),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151237),
          text:
              '"And returns them in better condition than some customers who actually pay," Zameer said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152114),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153137),
          text: 'Akhlaaq grinned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153137),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156997),
          text: '"So this is where the mysterious books come from."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157605),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158970),
          text: 'Imaan sat beside Rayyan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159577),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 161897),
          text: '"Do you like reading that much?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 161897),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163417),
          text: '"Very much."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163417),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168085),
          text:
              'She almost asked another question about school, but stopped herself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168794),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 169785),
          text: 'Rayyan noticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171885),
          text: '"You were going to ask something."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171885),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174325),
          text: '"I was," Imaan admitted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174325),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178425),
          text: '"But I am learning that curiosity is not permission."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179153),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180025),
          text: 'Rayyan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180025),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181025),
          text: '"Thank you."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 181592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183065),
          text: 'Zameer looked pleased.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183065),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189413),
          text:
              'He knew Rayyan had a difficult home life, but he did not know everything that happened inside the house.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189413),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196413),
          text:
              'What he did know was that the boy became calmer around books and kinder around people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197704),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200413),
          text: '"Rayyan," Zameer said, "remember something.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200413),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207441),
          text:
              'The kindness you give is not wasted just because nobody rewards you immediately."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 207954),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209901),
          text: 'Rayyan looked down at the book.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209901),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215141),
          text:
              '"Sometimes I wonder if kindness matters when other people are not kind."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215141),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218741),
          text: '"It matters," Zameer replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218741),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222461),
          text: '"But kindness does not mean letting people harm you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222461),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225141),
          text: 'A gentle heart still needs wisdom."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229869),
          text:
              'That sentence stayed with Imaan as much as it stayed with Rayyan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234349),
          text: 'That evening Uncle Kamran saw the book in Rayyan\'s bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237349),
          text: '"Another storybook?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 238381),
          text: '"I borrowed it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 238381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240349),
          text: 'I will return it tomorrow."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243349),
          text: 'Kamran sighed sharply.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246041),
          text: '"Books fill your head with dreams.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246041),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247849),
          text: 'You have work to do."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247849),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253877),
          text: 'Rayyan carefully placed the book away from the kitchen sink.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253877),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255688),
          text: '"I will finish everything."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256463),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260819),
          text:
              'Mutakabbir, who had come to speak with Kamran, laughed from the doorway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260819),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261171),
          text: '"See?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261171),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268165),
          text:
              'Give a child a little freedom and he starts believing he deserves more."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268165),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 272845),
          text: 'Kamran said nothing, but the words pleased his pride.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 272845),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278765),
          text:
              'The following afternoon, Rayyan returned the book to Zameer in perfect condition.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279382),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282565),
          text: 'Akhlaaq handed him another one from the shelf.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282565),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285085),
          text: '"This one has a boy who wants to become an inventor."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285253),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287653),
          text: 'Rayyan\'s eyes brightened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287653),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291953),
          text:
              '"You can borrow it after Zameer approves," Akhlaaq added quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291953),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293553),
          text: 'Zameer laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293553),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 294553),
          text: '"Approved."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294553),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297553),
          text: 'Rayyan held the book carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 298019),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301553),
          text: 'Imaan watched him and thought about quiet kindness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301553),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304053),
          text: 'It was not always dramatic.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304053),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307541),
          text: 'Sometimes it looked like carrying a bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 307541),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 311381),
          text: 'Sometimes it looked like returning a book carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 314741),
          text: 'Sometimes it looked like giving a person space.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314741),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 318801),
          text: 'And sometimes it looked like letting another person hope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320101),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324181),
          text: 'CHALLENGE OF THE DAY 2: Quiet Kindness',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 324181),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331349),
          text:
              'Your mission: Do one helpful thing today without announcing it or waiting to be praised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 336349),
          text:
              'Quick reflection: Would I still have done it if nobody thanked me?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 336349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 343391),
          text:
              'Level-Up: At the end of the day, privately thank Allah for giving you the opportunity to do good.',
        ),
      ],
