          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97518),
          text: 'Rayyan laughed despite himself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 97518),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103506),
          text:
              'Later, Imaan told Ammi about the conversation without sharing Rayyan\'s private details.',
