          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152502),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156421),
          text: 'For now, she did not have enough to assume anything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 156421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158142),
          text: 'So she chose patience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 158768),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160822),
          text: 'Akhlaaq had his own lesson that week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164684),
          text:
              'During a football game, he made a joke about Ali\'s slow running.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 166924),
          text: 'Everyone laughed except Ali.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 167577),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171110),
          text: 'Akhlaaq noticed the expression on his friend\'s face.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171110),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 172203),
          text: '"Ali, I am sorry.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172203),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173990),
          text: 'I thought it was funny."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174790),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175727),
          text: 'Ali shrugged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178624),
          text: '"You always think your own jokes are funny."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178624),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181350),
          text: '"That is because I have excellent taste.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 181478),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184538),
          text: 'But I still should not have embarrassed you."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184538),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186378),
          text: 'Ali smiled a little.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 186378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192778),
          text:
              'When Akhlaaq later told Imaan, she said, "Kindness with words is harder than it looks."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192778),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196078),
          text: '"Especially when you are naturally hilarious."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197378),
          text: '"Akhlaaq."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197912),
          text: '"Fine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197912),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199378),
          text: 'I am learning."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201446),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204946),
          text:
              'The next day Rayyan noticed a small bird struggling beside the park fountain.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
