          end: Duration(milliseconds: 29385),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 29385),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 32545),
          text: '"For once, there was a question we should have asked."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 32973),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 36593),
          text:
              'After the game, everyone gathered beneath the tree for snacks.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 36939),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 39793),
          text: 'Imaan opened a large container Ammi had packed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 39793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 41713),
          text: 'Rayyan immediately stood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 41713),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 43193),
          text: '"I should go."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43193),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44193),
          text: '"Why?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44739),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 45193),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 45193),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 46593),
          text: '"You are all eating."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 46593),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47593),
          text: '"Exactly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47593),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48593),
          text: 'Sit down."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48593),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 50273),
          text: 'Rayyan hesitated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54913),
          text:
              'Imaan noticed the way he looked at the food and then at his own small bread packet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54913),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 60381),
          text:
              'She almost said, "You can have ours because you do not have much," but stopped herself.',
