          text: 'That is the rule."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72909),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76829),
          text: 'Rayyan slowly sat.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76829),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 83869),
          text:
              'He opened his packet and placed his bread beside the other food.',
