          text: 'We made him part of the table."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107677),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112157),
          text: 'Nearby, two kittens appeared near the bushes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113326),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121345),
          text:
              'Rayyan broke off a small piece of plain chicken from his portion and placed it at a safe distance from the children.',
