          text:
              'That night he smoothed the pieces together beside his mattress.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240853),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249551),
          text:
              'The book itself was safe, but the little list he had written, words he wanted to learn, had been ripped apart.',
