          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282460),
          text: 'Rayyan fell silent.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282460),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286544),
          text:
              'Later Mutakabbir laughed when Kamran told him about the school.',
