          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243047),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247247),
          text:
              '"Sometimes it means checking what is on the other side first."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247987),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248727),
          text: 'Akhlaaq nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 251041),
          text: '"That sounded very Sheikh Uncle."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251041),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253447),
          text: '"I will take that as a compliment."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253447),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 258210),
          text: 'At home, Uncle Kamran noticed that Rayyan seemed lighter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258210),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259309),
          text: '"Where were you?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259309),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260775),
          text: '"At the reading room."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261335),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263256),
          text: 'Kamran\'s eyes narrowed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263256),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265481),
          text: '"With those children again?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 265481),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266695),
          text: 'Rayyan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268024),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271015),
          text: 'Mutakabbir, sitting nearby, gave Kamran a knowing look.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271735),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276416),
          text: '"He is becoming bold," he said after Rayyan left the room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278863),
          text: 'Kamran stared at the closed door.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 278863),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285063),
          text:
              'For the first time, the pride Mutakabbir fed him began to compete with another feeling.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285063),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286423),
          text: 'Fear.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286423),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288263),
          text: 'Not fear of Rayyan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288263),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291623),
          text: 'Fear that he was losing control.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292303),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 296391),
          text: 'CHALLENGE OF THE DAY 6: Help Wisely',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 296391),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307431),
          text:
              'Your mission: Think of someone you want to help. Before acting, ask what they actually need and whether your plan is safe, respectful and wanted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 307431),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313871),
          text:
              'Quick reflection: Did I solve the problem I saw, or did I first understand the person?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314359),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324759),
          text:
              'Level-Up: For a serious problem, identify one trustworthy adult or responsible person you could involve instead of trying to handle everything yourself.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'kindness_en_07',
      title: 'Ep 7 · When Kindness Needs Courage',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/kindness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/kindness/07_when_kindness_needs_courage.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Kindness That Came Back — episode 7 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3856),
          text: 'Chapter Seven: When Kindness Needs Courage',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 4356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 9424),
          text:
              'A few days later, Rayyan borrowed a beginner\'s science book from Zameer\'s shop.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 9424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 14271),
          text:
              'Inside it was a small leaflet from the Amanpur school reading programme.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 14924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 21724),
          text:
              'He had not asked for it, but he kept it because the picture of children studying made him smile.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 21724),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 25164),
          text: 'Uncle Kamran found the leaflet that evening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25164),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 26644),
          text: '"What is this?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 27544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 28444),
          text: 'Rayyan froze.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 29392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 32192),
          text: '"It is only information about the school."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 32192),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 35552),
          text: '"I told you to stop filling your head with this."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 35552),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37792),
          text: '"I only want to learn."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37792),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 41592),
          text: 'The words came out more firmly than Rayyan intended.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 41592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 43712),
          text: 'Kamran\'s face changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44612),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48912),
          text:
              'Mutakabbir\'s old advice rang in his mind: remind him who has power.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49360),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52000),
          text: 'Kamran lost his temper.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52000),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59440),
          text:
              'He snatched the book away, tore the leaflet and handled Rayyan roughly enough to frighten and hurt him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64300),
          text: 'When the anger passed, the room became painfully quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64601),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70948),
          text:
              'Rayyan sat beside the torn paper, shaken and ashamed even though he had done nothing shameful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 71660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73388),
          text: 'Kamran stood in the doorway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73388),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76628),
          text: 'For a moment he looked at the boy\'s frightened face.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76628),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79708),
          text: 'Again there was a hesitation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 80874),
          text: 'But he did not apologise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 84988),
          text: '"No more park," he said, and left.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 84988),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89800),
          text:
              'The following afternoon, Imaan and Akhlaaq waited beneath the old tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 90304),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91565),
          text: 'Rayyan did not come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91565),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94338),
          text: 'Nor did he come the next day.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94338),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101294),
          text:
              'On the third day, Akhlaaq stopped trying to invent cheerful explanations.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101294),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103024),
          text: '"Something is wrong."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 103457),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104106),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105296),
          text: '"I think so too."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105296),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112635),
          text:
              'When Rayyan finally appeared the next evening, he walked slowly and kept one arm close to his side.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113509),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116131),
          text: 'Akhlaaq\'s usual grin disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116131),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116630),
          text: '"Rayyan."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116630),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 120073),
          text: '"I am fine," Rayyan said before either of them had asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 120375),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124894),
          text:
              'Imaan remembered all the times she had stopped herself from questioning him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 124894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127390),
          text: 'Respecting privacy had been kind then.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127390),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129184),
          text: 'This moment felt different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131657),
          text: 'She spoke carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132079),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135348),
          text: '"Rayyan, you do not have to tell us every detail.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138707),
          text: 'But I need to ask one important question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138707),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140619),
          text: 'Do you feel safe at home?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141021),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142128),
          text: 'Rayyan looked at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144309),
          text: 'His eyes filled with tears.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144899),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 147754),
          text: 'Akhlaaq sat beside him, completely serious.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 147754),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 152000),
          text:
              '"You will not get us into trouble by telling the truth," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152329),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153318),
          text: 'Rayyan shook his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153318),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156690),
          text: '"Uncle Kamran will be angry if anyone knows."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157110),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158685),
          text: 'Imaan\'s heart tightened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 158685),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 161520),
          text: '"That is not the same as being safe."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162480),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165775),
          text: 'For a long moment Rayyan said nothing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165775),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168960),
          text: 'Then he whispered, "I am scared of him."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170622),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171142),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173012),
          text: 'They both understood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 173531),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175505),
          text: 'Rayyan wiped his face quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175505),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 177860),
          text: '"Please do not tell anyone."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178588),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179921),
          text: 'Akhlaaq took a breath.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 182103),
          text: '"I cannot promise that."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 182710),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184043),
          text: 'Rayyan stared at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184043),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186303),
          text: '"I can promise we will not gossip," Akhlaaq continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189793),
          text: '"We will not tell children in the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194176),
          text:
              'But if someone is hurting you, keeping it secret could leave you in danger."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195238),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195872),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195872),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197560),
          text: '"We need Sheikh Uncle."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199777),
          text: 'Rayyan looked terrified.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199777),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202416),
          text: '"What if Uncle Kamran finds out?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203216),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207658),
          text:
              '"Then responsible adults will decide how to help safely," Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 207658),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210127),
          text: '"You are not supposed to solve this.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210127),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211242),
          text: 'Neither are we."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211707),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213009),
          text: 'Rayyan lowered his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213567),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 217316),
          text: 'Akhlaaq reached out, but stopped before touching him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217316),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218890),
          text: '"Can I sit closer?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219495),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220222),
          text: 'Rayyan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220222),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222886),
          text: 'So Akhlaaq moved beside him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222886),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223733),
          text: 'No jokes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 223733),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224944),
          text: 'No speeches.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226957),
          text: 'Just company.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226957),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232152),
          text: 'The next morning, Imaan and Akhlaaq told Ammi and Abbu first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232152),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234912),
          text: 'Together they went to Sheikh Uncle.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 235228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239592),
          text:
              'Imaan was careful to separate what they knew from what they feared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242912),
          text: '"He told us he is scared at home," she said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242912),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245592),
          text: '"He did not describe everything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252560),
          text:
              'We noticed that he was absent, looked hurt and became frightened when we talked about Uncle Kamran."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255800),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle\'s expression became serious.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257920),
          text: '"You did the right thing."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258476),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259920),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked worried.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259920),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262560),
          text: '"Will Rayyan think we betrayed him?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268440),
          text:
              '"Telling a trusted adult about danger is not betrayal," Sheikh Uncle replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 273248),
          text: '"Kindness does not ask a child to carry harm in silence."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 273248),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278648),
          text:
              'That sentence changed Akhlaaq\'s understanding of kindness forever.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 278648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281528),
          text: 'Sometimes a kind friend shares food.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 281528),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284008),
          text: 'Sometimes a kind friend makes you laugh.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284008),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288568),
          text:
              'And sometimes a kind friend refuses to keep the secret that is hurting you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288976),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 294576),
          text: 'CHALLENGE OF THE DAY 7: Kindness Needs Courage',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294576),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307736),
          text:
              'Your mission: Learn the difference between a private matter and a dangerous secret. If you or another child may be unsafe, speak to a trusted adult rather than trying to solve it alone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 307736),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 314944),
          text:
              'Quick reflection: Who are three trustworthy adults I can speak to if something serious happens?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314944),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324944),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Practise saying: "I am worried about someone and I need help." You do not need to investigate or confront anyone yourself.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'kindness_en_08',
      title: 'Ep 8 · The Right Kind of Help',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/kindness.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/kindness/08_the_right_kind_of_help.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Kindness That Came Back — episode 8 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 0),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 2120),
          text: 'Chapter Eight: The Right Kind of Help',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3088),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 7588),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle did not rush to Uncle Kamran\'s house by himself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 7588),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 17588),
          text:
              'He contacted Sheikh Jawed, who worked with Amanpur\'s community welfare committee, and together they informed the responsible child-protection officers.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17588),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 21988),
          text:
              '"We must use facts," Sheikh Uncle explained to Imaan and Akhlaaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 23056),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 26856),
          text: '"Not rumours, not anger, and not guesses.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 26856),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33016),
          text:
              'Responsible adults will speak to Rayyan privately and decide what is needed to keep him safe."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33512),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34256),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34256),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 46544),
          text:
              'The lesson reminded her of something she had learned in other situations too: good intentions did not give anyone permission to ignore fairness or proper responsibility.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 46544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 51781),
          text:
              'That afternoon, Rayyan met the adults at the school office, away from Uncle Kamran.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52304),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54464),
          text: 'He was nervous at first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59104),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle sat nearby, but allowed the trained adults to speak with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 62304),
          text: '"You are not in trouble," one of them said gently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 62992),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 66712),
          text: '"We only want to understand what life is like for you."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67226),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 68872),
          text: 'Rayyan stared at the floor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68872),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72872),
          text: 'For years he had learned to say, "Everything is fine."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72872),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 75112),
          text: 'This time he told the truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85800),
          text:
              'He spoke about the work, the fear, the way Uncle Kamran tried to stop him from making friends or learning, and the recent moment when Kamran\'s anger had crossed a line.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 88880),
          text: 'When he finished, he looked exhausted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 88880),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 90485),
          text: '"Will he be angry?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91103),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91720),
          text: 'Rayyan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95360),
          text: '"The adults will deal with his reaction," Sheikh Uncle said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95360),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98400),
          text: '"Your job is to be truthful and safe."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98400),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102928),
          text:
              'The child-protection team arranged for Rayyan not to return to the house that evening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102928),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108190),
          text:
              'They contacted a maternal aunt, Khala Hira, who lived in another part of Amanpur.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108928),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114928),
          text:
